# Cursor rules workflow

Use when editing project rules or [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md).

## Rule structure

```markdown
---
description: Clear one-line description
globs: path/to/files/*.ext
alwaysApply: false
---

# Title

Actionable bullets. Prefer ✅ DO / ❌ DON'T when it clarifies.
```

## Conventions

- One concern per rule; keep under ~100 lines when possible.
- Link with `[name](mdc:path)` instead of duplicating long tables from [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md).
- Add a rule when a pattern appears in 3+ places, reviews keep repeating it, or a bug class is preventable by a checklist.
- Update stack/layout in AGENTS.md when the project is bootstrapped — do not invent a parallel source of truth.
